\n\n<p>۰۲۱۸۸۶۱۵۸۹۰</p>\n\n\n\n<p>تلگرام : <br>۰۹۰۵۰۵۷۱۵۱۷</p>\n\n\n\n<p>جهت ثبت‌نام :</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-left\"><a href=\"https://evnd.co/tB8oS\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://evnd.co/tB8oS</a></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d68a6d3 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"d68a6d3\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;jet_parallax_layout_list&quot;:[]}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-347cc3e elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"347cc3e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"/media/news/5aad62313fe50c98.webp\" width=\"819\" height=\"1024\" alt=\"\">\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t"}